    "title": "Beckley Water rate case goes before PSC Wednesday as customers push back - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caleb Pearl ,\n7 hours ago Beckley, WV (WOAY) – The Public Service Commission held an evidentiary hearing at the Tamarack Conference Center in Beckley on Wednesday over a proposed rate increase for Beckley Water Company, which serves more than 22,000 customers across Raleigh and Fayette counties. Beckley Water initially sought a 22.7% rate increase.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
